OL,3,GNEWSACladding replacement at flats to
OL,4,Atake 18 months
OL,5,
OL,6,FReplacing cladding on a block of flats
OL,7,Fwill take 18 months but most residents
OL,8,Fshould be able to stay in their homes
OL,9,Fthroughout the work, a developer says.
OL,11,FMaterial surrounding 215 occupied flats
OL,12,Fat The Mill building on Ipswich's
OL,13,Fwaterfront does not meet fire safety
OL,14,Fregulations and needs to be removed.
OL,16,FDeveloper John Howard, who bought the
OL,17,Fbuilding for #1 in 2024, said he had
OL,18,Fsecured government funding to pay for
OL,19,Fthe work and it was due to take place
OL,20,Fbetween November 2026 and early 2028.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
